OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 7 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including Beethoven's
OL,8,     GEroica Symphony and Mahler's
OL,9,     GBlumine.
OL,10,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,11,     GThe world plunges into war, with
OL,12,     GHungary at the centre. Donald
OL,13,     GMacleod explores the life of one
OL,14,     Gof Hungary's greatest composers,
OL,15,     Gwho travelled Europe recording
OL,16,     Gfolk songs.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GLive music from The United
OL,19,     GStrings of Europe. Anna Clyne on
OL,20,     Gthe world premiere of her work
OL,21,     GSirens.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Radio CTravel FNat Sport
