OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 7 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GAlice Zawazdki selects a swirling
OL,12,     Grelease from the Danish bass
OL,13,     Gplayer.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GThe Orchestra dell'Accademia
OL,16,     GNazionale di Santa Cecilia
OL,17,     Gperforms works by Mozart, and a
OL,18,     Gpremiere of Musica serena by
OL,19,     GPeteris Vasks. Later, Mozart's
OL,20,     GConcerto for flute and harp.
